# fluks

Free file sharing built for creators.

Upload any photo or video and get an instant shareable link. No sign-up, no payment, no limits.

### How it works
1. Upload your photo/video
2. fluks generates a link
3. Share the link - anyone can download/view

### Features
- 🚀 Fast uploads
- 🔗 Instant shareable links
- 🆓 100% Free
- 📸 Photos & Videos
- 🌍 From Kosovo to the world

